{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂浪漫、私の回が放送されました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/3049093/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「野菊の墓」\nいかがでしたか？\n切ないお話ですね、、、\n読んでてちょっとうるうるきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/3049093/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浪漫は録画したのを毎朝見て楽しんでます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/3049093/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"興味が出てその本を読みたくなっちゃいますね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週はどんなお話かなo(^-^)o ワクワク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/3049093/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は１週間ずっとのんびりでした。\nこんなにのんびり出来るのは久しぶりです。\nでも今日はまいまいと二人で自主練してきました♪\n楽しかったよ(*^▽^*)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで\n今週は新しく始まった高校生活に専念してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/3049093/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しいことをいろいろ学んでます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はひめたんの誕生日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/3049093/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうヾ(´・∀・)ノ << Happy Birthday♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは同い年だけど、お姉さんっぽい存在でいつもお世話になってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/3049093/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にふざけたり色んな話したりすっごく楽しい(≧∇≦)\nこれからもずっとずっとよろしく"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/14/3049093/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生活もお互いがんばろうねっｐ(●`∇´●)ｑ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}